## Re-Audit Findings (2026-08-01)

New issues discovered during the follow-up UI/UX re-audit after the initial fixes were applied.

### N1: Consolidate duplicate light-mode CSS rules in globals.css (CRITICAL)
- [x] N1.1: Remove duplicate `html[data-theme="light"]` selectors that appear twice with conflicting values
- [x] N1.2: Duplicates found for: `.bg-[#0F172A]`, `.text-[#94A3B8]`, `.text-[#64748B]`, `.border-[rgba(148,163,184,0.08)]`, `.border-[rgba(148,163,184,0.12)]`, `.bg-[#111827]`, `.bg-[#1E293B]`
- [x] N1.3: Keep a single canonical set of light-mode overrides and remove the redundant block (lines ~256-282)

### N2: Implement true chat minimize/dock state (not just close)
- [x] N2.1: Change the "Minimize" button in `AIChatWidget.tsx` to collapse to a docked pill that preserves the conversation
- [x] N2.2: Add a separate "Close" action that fully dismisses the widget
- [x] N2.3: Ensure the docked state is distinguishable from the closed state

### N3: Add null-check + fallback to `useSmoothScroll` hook
- [x] N3.1: Update `lib/useSmoothScroll.ts` to return a boolean success indicator
- [ ] N3.2: Show a toast or inline message when the scroll target is not found
- [x] N3.3: Fall back to scrolling to top or a default section when target is missing

### N4: Localize Phase3Labs for Arabic + add input labels
- [x] N4.1: Pass `locale` prop to `Phase3Labs.tsx` and render Arabic strings on `/ar`
- [x] N4.2: Add `aria-label` or visible `<label>` to all Phase3Labs inputs (bearer token, ticket title, affected service, description)
- [x] N4.3: Localize the "Productized AI Ops" section header and product card for AR

### N5: Add portal login affordances
- [x] N5.1: Add password visibility toggle to the portal login password field
- [x] N5.2: Add loading/disabled state + `aria-busy` to the portal submit button while authenticating
- [x] N5.3: Add a "Forgot password?" link and a clear error/success toast

### N6: Add skip-to-content link
- [x] N6.1: Add a "Skip to content" link as the first focusable element in `layout.tsx`
- [x] N6.2: Ensure it becomes visible on focus and targets the `<main>` content

### N7: Add `aria-live` region to chat message container
- [x] N7.1: Add `aria-live="polite"` to the chat message list in `AIChatWidget.tsx`
- [x] N7.2: Ensure screen readers announce new assistant messages

### N8: Add focus management to mobile menu
- [x] N8.1: Implement focus trap when the mobile menu is open
- [x] N8.2: Close the menu on `Escape` key
- [x] N8.3: Return focus to the toggle button when the menu closes

### N9: Disable Terminal typing effect for reduced-motion users
- [x] N9.1: Check `prefers-reduced-motion` in `Terminal.tsx` JS and skip the typing animation
- [x] N9.2: Render the full command text statically when reduced motion is active
- [x] N9.3: Disable the cursor blink for reduced-motion users
